      "id": "claim_43d42ca7225344f0b28b6a429ec11dbf",
      "statement": "The consents gate can be enabled with an alternate setup file (rhc.setup.consents.ts) that extends the base setup with a user schema, permission for users to PATCH their own consents, JWT claims for version strings, and a Guards rule that blocks users who haven't accepted current ToS/Privacy Policy with HTTP 451.",
